{"seq":1,"slug":"saga-choreography","title":"Saga 模式：分布式事务的编排与协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/saga-choreography","wordCount":929,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"saga-模式-分布式事务的编排与协作\">Saga 模式：分布式事务的编排与协作</h1><p>分布式系统中，一个业务操作往往跨越多个微服务，每个服务拥有独立的数据库。传统的两阶段提交（2PC）在微服务架构下代价极高——锁定周期长、可用性低。Saga 模式通过将长事务拆分为一系列本地事务，并为每个本地事务定义对应的<strong>补偿事务</strong>，在不依赖分布式锁的情况下实现最终一致性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Saga</strong> 是一个由有序本地事务构成的序列，其中每个步骤要么成功提交，要么触发之前所有已完成步骤的补偿操作（Compensating Transaction）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本地事务</td>\n<td>单个服务内的原子操作，成功后发布领域事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补偿事务</td>\n<td>撤销对应本地事务效果的操作（语义撤销，不是物理回滚）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pivot 事务</td>\n<td>Saga 中的关键节点：通过后 Saga 进入完成轨道，无需补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可重试事务</td>\n<td>Pivot 之后的步骤，通过幂等重试保证最终完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"编排-saga-orchestration-saga\">编排 Saga（Orchestration Saga）</h2><p>编排 Saga 引入<strong>中心协调器</strong>（Orchestrator），由它驱动各服务按序执行，并负责在失败时触发补偿。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant O as 订单 Orchestrator&#10;    participant S as 库存服务&#10;    participant P as 支付服务&#10;    participant N as 通知服务&#10;&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;S: 锁定库存&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;O: 库存已锁定&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;P: 扣款&#10;    P--&gt;&gt;O: 扣款失败&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;S: 释放库存(补偿)&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;O: 补偿完成&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;O: Saga 失败,标记订单取消\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant O as 订单 Orchestrator\n    participant S as 库存服务\n    participant P as 支付服务\n    participant N as 通知服务\n\n    O-&gt;&gt;S: 锁定库存\n    S--&gt;&gt;O: 库存已锁定\n    O-&gt;&gt;P: 扣款\n    P--&gt;&gt;O: 扣款失败\n    O-&gt;&gt;S: 释放库存(补偿)\n    S--&gt;&gt;O: 补偿完成\n    O-&gt;&gt;O: Saga 失败,标记订单取消</pre><p>Orchestrator 实现示例（Go 伪代码）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type OrderSaga struct {&#10;    inventorySvc InventoryService&#10;    paymentSvc   PaymentService&#10;    notifySvc    NotifyService&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (s *OrderSaga) Execute(ctx context.Context, order Order) error {&#10;    // Step 1: 锁定库存&#10;    if err := s.inventorySvc.Reserve(ctx, order.Items); err != nil {&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // Step 2: 扣款&#10;    if err := s.paymentSvc.Charge(ctx, order.Amount); err != nil {&#10;        // 补偿 Step 1&#10;        _ = s.inventorySvc.Release(ctx, order.Items)&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // Step 3: 发送通知（可重试，无需补偿）&#10;    _ = s.notifySvc.Send(ctx, order.UserID, &quot;订单已创建&quot;)&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderSaga</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inventorySvc </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">InventoryService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    paymentSvc   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaymentService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    notifySvc    </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NotifyService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderSaga</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Step 1: 锁定库存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.inventorySvc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reserve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, order.Items); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Step 2: 扣款</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.paymentSvc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Charge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, order.Amount); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 补偿 Step 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.inventorySvc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, order.Items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Step 3: 发送通知（可重试，无需补偿）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.notifySvc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, order.UserID, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"订单已创建\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：逻辑集中，调试容易，状态可视。<br><strong>缺点</strong>：Orchestrator 成为瓶颈，服务间存在双向耦合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协作-saga-choreography-saga\">协作 Saga（Choreography Saga）</h2><p>协作 Saga 中没有中心协调器——每个服务监听事件，完成本地事务后发布新事件，由事件驱动整个流程推进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    OC[订单服务\\n发布 OrderCreated] --&gt;|订阅| IS[库存服务]&#10;    IS --&gt;|库存已锁定| PS[支付服务]&#10;    PS --&gt;|支付成功| NS[通知服务]&#10;    PS --&gt;|支付失败| CF[发布 PaymentFailed]&#10;    CF --&gt;|订阅| IS2[库存服务\\n触发补偿: 释放库存]&#10;    IS2 --&gt;|库存已释放| OC2[订单服务\\n标记订单失败]\">flowchart LR\n    OC[订单服务\\n发布 OrderCreated] --&gt;|订阅| IS[库存服务]\n    IS --&gt;|库存已锁定| PS[支付服务]\n    PS --&gt;|支付成功| NS[通知服务]\n    PS --&gt;|支付失败| CF[发布 PaymentFailed]\n    CF --&gt;|订阅| IS2[库存服务\\n触发补偿: 释放库存]\n    IS2 --&gt;|库存已释放| OC2[订单服务\\n标记订单失败]</pre><p><strong>Kafka 事件主题设计</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"topic: order.created        → 库存服务消费&#10;topic: inventory.reserved   → 支付服务消费&#10;topic: payment.completed    → 通知服务消费&#10;topic: payment.failed       → 库存服务消费（触发补偿）&#10;topic: inventory.released   → 订单服务消费（更新状态）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>topic: order.created        → 库存服务消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>topic: inventory.reserved   → 支付服务消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>topic: payment.completed    → 通知服务消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>topic: payment.failed       → 库存服务消费（触发补偿）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>topic: inventory.released   → 订单服务消费（更新状态）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：服务完全解耦，无单点故障。<br><strong>缺点</strong>：流程散布在各服务中，难以追踪整体状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种-saga-模式对比\">两种 Saga 模式对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>编排 Saga</th>\n<th>协作 Saga</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>控制逻辑</td>\n<td>集中在 Orchestrator</td>\n<td>分散在各服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务耦合</td>\n<td>Orchestrator 知道所有服务</td>\n<td>服务只知道事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视性</td>\n<td>高（状态机清晰）</td>\n<td>低（需追踪事件链）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点风险</td>\n<td>Orchestrator 故障影响全局</td>\n<td>无单点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试难度</td>\n<td>低（单独测 Orchestrator）</td>\n<td>高（需端到端集成测试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>步骤复杂、需审计的业务流</td>\n<td>步骤简单、高解耦需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"幂等性与补偿设计要点\">幂等性与补偿设计要点</h2><p>Saga 能正确工作的前提是<strong>幂等性</strong>：同一个操作被重复执行多次，结果与执行一次相同。补偿操作也必须是幂等的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 使用唯一 sagaID + 步骤标识实现幂等&#10;func (s *InventoryService) Reserve(ctx context.Context, sagaID string, items []Item) error {&#10;    key := fmt.Sprintf(&quot;saga:%s:inventory&quot;, sagaID)&#10;    ok, err := s.redis.SetNX(ctx, key, &quot;reserved&quot;, 24*time.Hour).Result()&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;    if !ok {&#10;        return nil // 已执行过，直接返回成功&#10;    }&#10;    return s.db.ReserveItems(ctx, items)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用唯一 sagaID + 步骤标识实现幂等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">InventoryService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reserve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sagaID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"saga:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:inventory\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sagaID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ok, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetNX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, key, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reserved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Hour).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ok {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 已执行过，直接返回成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReserveItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"状态追踪-saga-日志表\">状态追踪：Saga 日志表</h2><p>为了在故障恢复时知道 Saga 执行到哪一步，建议使用<strong>Saga 状态表</strong>持久化每一步的状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>saga_id</code></td>\n<td>UUID</td>\n<td>Saga 唯一标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>step</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>当前步骤名（如 <code>inventory.reserve</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>status</code></td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>PENDING / COMPLETED / COMPENSATING / FAILED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>payload</code></td>\n<td>JSONB</td>\n<td>步骤输入快照，用于重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>created_at</code></td>\n<td>timestamp</td>\n<td>步骤开始时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>updated_at</code></td>\n<td>timestamp</td>\n<td>最后更新时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键运维检查项\">关键运维检查项</h2><ul>\n<li>Saga 超时监控：设置全局 Saga TTL，超时的 Saga 自动触发补偿流程</li>\n<li>补偿失败告警：补偿操作失败须人工介入，不能静默忽略</li>\n<li>孤儿 Saga 清理：定期扫描长时间无进展的 Saga 并触发补偿或标记废弃</li>\n<li>幂等键过期设置：Redis SetNX 的 TTL 应大于最长预期重试周期</li>\n<li>与<a href=\"dead-letter-queue\">死信队列与错误处理</a>联动：补偿失败的消息路由至 DLQ 等待人工处理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Saga 模式通过本地事务 + 补偿事务将分布式长事务分解为可管理的步骤序列。编排 Saga 逻辑集中、可视性强，适合复杂业务流；协作 Saga 服务解耦、弹性好，适合高自治场景。两种模式的核心都依赖幂等性设计与显式的补偿操作，缺一不可。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Saga 模式：分布式事务的编排与协作","id":"saga-模式-分布式事务的编排与协作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编排 Saga（Orchestration Saga）","id":"编排-saga-orchestration-saga"},{"level":2,"text":"协作 Saga（Choreography Saga）","id":"协作-saga-choreography-saga"},{"level":2,"text":"两种 Saga 模式对比","id":"两种-saga-模式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等性与补偿设计要点","id":"幂等性与补偿设计要点"},{"level":2,"text":"状态追踪：Saga 日志表","id":"状态追踪-saga-日志表"},{"level":2,"text":"关键运维检查项","id":"关键运维检查项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"消息顺序与投递语义：顺序保证与投递模式的工程权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/fundamentals/message-ordering-delivery"},"next":{"title":"事件溯源与消息系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/event-sourcing-messaging"}}